            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.14+NEH.10.15+NEH.10.16+NEH.10.17+NEH.10.18+NEH.10.19+NEH.10.20+NEH.10.21+NEH.10.22+NEH.10.23+NEH.10.24+NEH.10.25+NEH.10.26+NEH.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.14",
              "NEH.10.15",
              "NEH.10.16",
              "NEH.10.17",
              "NEH.10.18",
              "NEH.10.19",
              "NEH.10.20",
              "NEH.10.21",
              "NEH.10.22",
              "NEH.10.23",
              "NEH.10.24",
              "NEH.10.25",
              "NEH.10.26",
              "NEH.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We, the people of Israel, the priests, the Levites, the temple guards, the temple musicians, the temple workmen, and all others who in obedience to God's Law have separated themselves from the foreigners living in our land, we, together with our wives and all our children old enough to understand, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do hereby join with our leaders in an oath, under penalty of a curse if we break it, that we will live according to God's Law, which God gave through his servant Moses; that we will obey all that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", our Lord, commands us; and that we will keep all his laws and requirements.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
